7] [17592186560869 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "120de378-6c5c-5a20-a5a4-fe230e702451" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186560375 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186560389 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186560547 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186560610 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186560700 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186560700 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186560932 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "9f0af83d-008f-57e3-8335-76248a77c51e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561008 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186560932 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561008 #edb/ref 1069 "q-184490" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561008 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561008 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following is a representation of the set $S=\\{-2,0,2\\}\\times \\{1,4\\}$ in the Cartesian plane?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561008 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "68fa150f-fc38-56f5-947b-bb3d8c8fe527" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561008 #edb/ref 1074 "The Cartesian product $A\\times B$ consists of all ordered pairs whose first coordinate belongs to $A$ and whose second coordinate belongs to $B.$\n\nIn this case, computing $\\{-2,0,2\\}\\times \\{1,4\\}$ gives the following set:\n\n$$\nS=\\{(-2,1),(-2,4),(0,1),(0,4),(2,1),(2,4)\\}.\n$$\n\nOur visualization of this set is shown in the diagram below.\n\n![](images/86/86598866633d3a49c13cf979b0c2c9de74d147e4584a1c6a88847434bc9d3bbf.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561022 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186560869 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561022 #edb/ref 1069 "q-182004" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561022 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561022 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following is a representation of the set $S=\\{-2,1,2\\}\\times [0,2]$ in the Cartesian plane?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561022 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "871c3eee-78f1-5d74-b0c7-258b8f08a0ed" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186561022 #edb/ref 1074 "The Cartesian product $A\\times B$ consists of all ordered pairs whose first coordinate belongs to $A$ and whose second coordinate belongs to $B.$\n\n$$\nA\\times B=\\{(a,b)\\,:\\,a\\in A,\\,b\\in B\\}\n$$\n\nIn this case, the set \n\n$$\nS=\\{-2,1,2\\}\\times [0,2]\n$$\n\ncontains every point in ${R}^{2}$ whose $x$-coordinate is either $-2,1,$ or $2$ and whose $y$-coordinate is any real number in the interval $[0,2].$\n\n$$\nS=\\{(x,y)\\,:\\,x\\in \\{-2,1,2\\},\\,y\\in [0,2]\\}.\n$$\n\nTo visualize $S$, consider ${S}_{1}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate equals $-2$ and whose $y$-coordinate is any real number in the interval $[0,2].$\n\n$$\n{S}_{1}=\\{(-2,y)\\,:\\,y\\in [0,2]\\}\n$$\n\nThis set is represented by the line segment shown below.\n\n![](images/44/449b948df4a32c540281ddac1659c261e2908433ecc1f383b26cb5cb4aa29756.png)\n\nNext, consider ${S}_{2}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate equals $1$ and whose $y$-coordinate is any real number in the interval $[0,2].$\n\n$$\n{S}_{2}=\\{(1,y)\\,:\\,y\\in [0,2]\\}.\n$$\n\nThis set is represented by the line segment shown below.\n\n![](images/92/922c96e62e8ed3481e595595e060956fbaf191cd3ec7636e7a874b11fea3bcd5.png)\n\nNow, consider ${S}_{3}⊂S$ containing all points whose $x$-coordinate equals $2$ and whose $y$-coordinate is any real number in the interval $[0,2].$\n\n$$\n{S}_{2}=\\{(2,y)\\,:\\,y\\in [0,2]\\}.\n$$\n\nThis set is represented by the line segment shown below.\n\n![](images/0d/0d3cb62f7e9fb47823d0a2ba8c071e09adbea673ad54a5d1b014e8882aeff472.png)\n\nOur Cartesian product is the *union* of these subsets:\n\n$$\nS={S}_{1}\\cup {S}_{2}\\cup {S}_{3}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $S$ can be represented by the three line segments shown below.\n\n![](images/f7/f7cecda03e84263537cb29bbd14bb4dccc2e60fada10db1ca96798490e978676.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
